+# To-do app
+
+Open `index.html` in a browser. Tasks are saved in localStorage under `todos` as an array of `{id, text, done}` objects. The All, Active, and Completed buttons change which tasks are shown without changing that saved array. Reloading starts on All.
+
+Run `node --test tests/*.test.mjs` to check filtering, persistence, and the existing add, toggle, and delete actions.
